{"seq":3,"slug":"aws-fis-commercial","title":"AWS FIS 与商业混沌工程平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/platforms/aws-fis-commercial","wordCount":714,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"aws-fis-与商业混沌工程平台\">AWS FIS 与商业混沌工程平台</h1><p>除了开源工具，云厂商和商业公司也提供了成熟的混沌工程平台。<strong>AWS Fault Injection Simulator（FIS）</strong> 是 AWS 官方混沌工程服务，与 AWS 生态深度集成。商业平台如 Gremlin 则提供企业级的安全控制和可观测性集成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FIS 实验模板</td>\n<td>定义故障注入动作和停止条件的 JSON/YAML 配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FIS 动作（Action）</td>\n<td>AWS FIS 提供的原子故障注入操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>停止条件（Stop Condition）</td>\n<td>基于 CloudWatch 告警自动终止实验的条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gremlin 攻击（Attack）</td>\n<td>Gremlin 平台对故障注入操作的称呼</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"aws-fault-injection-simulator\">AWS Fault Injection Simulator</h2><p>AWS FIS（现称为 AWS Fault Injection Service）是 AWS 原生混沌工程服务，支持对 EC2、ECS、EKS、RDS 等 AWS 服务注入故障。</p>\n<p><strong>FIS 支持的故障动作</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>服务</th>\n<th>动作类型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>EC2</td>\n<td>实例重启、终止、CPU 压力、网络中断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ECS/EKS</td>\n<td>任务停止、节点排干、网络故障</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RDS</td>\n<td>故障转移、重启实例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VPC</td>\n<td>网络连通性变更</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Route53</td>\n<td>DNS 健康检查失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SSM</td>\n<td>在实例上运行任意故障注入命令</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>FIS 实验模板示例</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;description&quot;: &quot;终止 20% 的订单服务 EC2 实例&quot;,&#10;  &quot;targets&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;order-instances&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;resourceType&quot;: &quot;aws:ec2:instance&quot;,&#10;      &quot;resourceTags&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;Service&quot;: &quot;order-service&quot;,&#10;        &quot;Environment&quot;: &quot;production&quot;&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;selectionMode&quot;: &quot;PERCENT(20)&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;actions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;terminate-instances&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;actionId&quot;: &quot;aws:ec2:terminate-instances&quot;,&#10;      &quot;parameters&quot;: {},&#10;      &quot;targets&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;Instances&quot;: &quot;order-instances&quot;&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;startAfter&quot;: []&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;stopConditions&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;source&quot;: &quot;aws:cloudwatch:alarm&quot;,&#10;      &quot;value&quot;: &quot;arn:aws:cloudwatch:us-east-1:123456789:alarm/HighErrorRate&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;roleArn&quot;: &quot;arn:aws:iam::123456789:role/FISExperimentRole&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"终止 20% 的订单服务 EC2 实例\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"targets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"order-instances\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"resourceType\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"aws:ec2:instance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"resourceTags\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"Service\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order-service\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"Environment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"production\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"selectionMode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PERCENT(20)\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"actions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"terminate-instances\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"actionId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"aws:ec2:terminate-instances\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"parameters\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"targets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"Instances\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order-instances\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"startAfter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"stopConditions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"source\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"aws:cloudwatch:alarm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"arn:aws:cloudwatch:us-east-1:123456789:alarm/HighErrorRate\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"roleArn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"arn:aws:iam::123456789:role/FISExperimentRole\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>通过 Terraform 管理 FIS 实验</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"hcl\" data-code=\"resource &quot;aws_fis_experiment_template&quot; &quot;order_service_chaos&quot; {&#10;  description = &quot;测试订单服务实例终止后的弹性&quot;&#10;  role_arn    = aws_iam_role.fis_role.arn&#10;&#10;  target {&#10;    name           = &quot;order-instances&quot;&#10;    resource_type  = &quot;aws:ec2:instance&quot;&#10;    selection_mode = &quot;PERCENT(20)&quot;&#10;&#10;    resource_tag {&#10;      key   = &quot;Service&quot;&#10;      value = &quot;order-service&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  action {&#10;    name      = &quot;terminate&quot;&#10;    action_id = &quot;aws:ec2:terminate-instances&quot;&#10;    target {&#10;      key   = &quot;Instances&quot;&#10;      value = &quot;order-instances&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  stop_condition {&#10;    source = &quot;aws:cloudwatch:alarm&quot;&#10;    value  = aws_cloudwatch_metric_alarm.high_error_rate.arn&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>resource \"aws_fis_experiment_template\" \"order_service_chaos\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  description = \"测试订单服务实例终止后的弹性\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  role_arn    = aws_iam_role.fis_role.arn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  target {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    name           = \"order-instances\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    resource_type  = \"aws:ec2:instance\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    selection_mode = \"PERCENT(20)\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    resource_tag {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      key   = \"Service\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      value = \"order-service\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  action {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    name      = \"terminate\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    action_id = \"aws:ec2:terminate-instances\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    target {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      key   = \"Instances\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      value = \"order-instances\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  stop_condition {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    source = \"aws:cloudwatch:alarm\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    value  = aws_cloudwatch_metric_alarm.high_error_rate.arn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"gremlin-企业级混沌平台\">Gremlin：企业级混沌平台</h2><p>Gremlin 提供商业版混沌工程平台，核心优势是精细的安全控制和审计能力：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    GREMLIN[Gremlin SaaS 平台] --&gt;|控制信号| AGENT[Gremlin Agent\\n部署在目标主机/Pod]&#10;    AGENT --&gt;|注入故障| TARGET[目标系统]&#10;    TARGET --&gt;|指标| MONITOR[监控集成\\nDatadog/PagerDuty]&#10;    MONITOR --&gt;|告警| GREMLIN\">flowchart LR\n    GREMLIN[Gremlin SaaS 平台] --&gt;|控制信号| AGENT[Gremlin Agent\\n部署在目标主机/Pod]\n    AGENT --&gt;|注入故障| TARGET[目标系统]\n    TARGET --&gt;|指标| MONITOR[监控集成\\nDatadog/PagerDuty]\n    MONITOR --&gt;|告警| GREMLIN</pre><p><strong>Gremlin 支持的攻击类型</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>具体攻击</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>资源</td>\n<td>CPU、内存、磁盘 I/O、磁盘空间耗尽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络</td>\n<td>延迟、丢包、带宽限制、黑洞（完全阻断）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态</td>\n<td>进程 Kill、时间偏移、关机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kubernetes</td>\n<td>Pod Kill、节点删除</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Gremlin API 触发攻击</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"curl -X POST https://api.gremlin.com/v1/attacks/new \\&#10;  -H &quot;Authorization: Key $GREMLIN_API_KEY&quot; \\&#10;  -H &quot;Content-Type: application/json&quot; \\&#10;  -d &#39;{&#10;    &quot;category&quot;: &quot;network&quot;,&#10;    &quot;type&quot;: &quot;latency&quot;,&#10;    &quot;args&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;-l&quot;: 300,        // 延迟 300ms&#10;      &quot;-p&quot;: 10          // 10% 丢包&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;target&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;Container&quot;,&#10;      &quot;tags&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;service&quot;: &quot;payment-service&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -X</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> POST</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://api.gremlin.com/v1/attacks/new</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -H</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Authorization: Key </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$GREMLIN_API_KEY</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -H</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Content-Type: application/json\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"category\": \"network\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"type\": \"latency\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"args\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"-l\": 300,        // 延迟 300ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"-p\": 10          // 10% 丢包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"target\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"type\": \"Container\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"tags\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"service\": \"payment-service\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  }'</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"工具横向对比\">工具横向对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Litmus/Chaos Mesh</th>\n<th>AWS FIS</th>\n<th>Gremlin</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>运行环境</td>\n<td>Kubernetes</td>\n<td>AWS</td>\n<td>多云/On-Prem</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定价</td>\n<td>免费</td>\n<td>按实验计费</td>\n<td>商业许可证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全控制</td>\n<td>基础（RBAC）</td>\n<td>IAM + CloudTrail</td>\n<td>企业级（SSO/审计/角色）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>故障类型</td>\n<td>丰富</td>\n<td>AWS 原生</td>\n<td>全面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可观测性集成</td>\n<td>手动配置</td>\n<td>CloudWatch 原生</td>\n<td>内置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技术支持</td>\n<td>社区</td>\n<td>AWS Support</td>\n<td>专业支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合场景</td>\n<td>K8s 云原生</td>\n<td>AWS 平台用户</td>\n<td>企业级、合规要求高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"关键实践清单\">关键实践清单</h2><ul>\n<li>AWS FIS 的 stopConditions 必须配置，不能让实验无限运行</li>\n<li>Gremlin 的 Blast Radius 功能可精确限制攻击范围到特定容器或主机</li>\n<li>所有商业平台的 API Key 存储在 Secrets Manager，不要硬编码</li>\n<li>混沌实验的 IAM 角色应遵循最小权限，只授予必要的故障注入权限</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>AWS FIS 是 AWS 用户的最低摩擦选择，与 CloudWatch/IAM 深度集成；Gremlin 提供企业级安全控制和多云支持，适合对合规性要求高的组织；开源的 Litmus/Chaos Mesh 则适合 Kubernetes 优先且预算有限的团队。工具选择应基于现有基础设施和团队能力，而不是追求最强大的平台。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"AWS FIS 与商业混沌工程平台","id":"aws-fis-与商业混沌工程平台"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"AWS Fault Injection Simulator","id":"aws-fault-injection-simulator"},{"level":2,"text":"Gremlin：企业级混沌平台","id":"gremlin-企业级混沌平台"},{"level":2,"text":"工具横向对比","id":"工具横向对比"},{"level":2,"text":"关键实践清单","id":"关键实践清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Litmus 与 Chaos Mesh：Kubernetes 原生混沌平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/platforms/litmus-chaos-mesh"},"next":{"title":"混沌工程成熟度模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/maturity/chaos-maturity-model"}}